{
  "name": "PDF Financial Reports & Earnings Tables to Clean Markdown / JSON Extractor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ PDF Financial Reports & Earnings Tables to Clean Markdown / JSON Extractor\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nExtract complex financial tables from PDF reports into structured Markdown and JSON for automated AI financial analysis.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/pdf-table-financial-report-markdown-extractor`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/pdf-table-financial-report-markdown-extractor) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify PDF Financial Report & Table Extractor** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "5c72387f-3c93-4acb-ac22-dcd43a5db835",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **PDF Financial Report & Table Extractor** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "4de8d2eb-9340-4e53-a367-eaf924adec8e",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "9c2f32c0-388c-4725-a1ee-cd509c37621b",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ea4bce39-bc73-4b77-a39c-b6aa19cd5a11",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "739a4665-ae4e-4e6c-a18e-1fb05cc527cd",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"Q4 10-K financial tables revenue breakdown\",\"SaaS investor deck ARR metrics PDF\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "8ffc146e-f2f4-4bba-a5a5-afce4319228c",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "4054eb7e-830c-4d16-a563-0518011b84bb",
